{"id":"363ec18ceab52b90","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Minimal Element Set","display":"df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set — ZFC Order12 Minimal Element Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set — ZFC Order12 Minimal Element Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set — ZFC Order12 Minimal Element Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1626fd1f4581397b\" href=\"?note=1626fd1f4581397b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md\">58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,A,M\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,A,M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (minimal-element predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land M=\\{x\\in A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land M=\\{x\\in A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and order relation are now explicit, and the set is formed from the canonical minimal-element predicate. Minimal means “nothing strictly below,” not “below every member.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md","status":"resolved","id":"1626fd1f4581397b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,A,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MinimalElementSet}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land M=\\{x\\in A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(x,A,P,\\leq_P)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2919","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set.md|58-df-zfc-order12-minimal-element-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","1626fd1f4581397b"]}